    <main id="main" class="worship-shell">
      <article class="worship-letter ways-letter">
        <div class="worship-celestial" aria-hidden="true"><span class="worship-moon">☾</span><span class="worship-star worship-star-one">✦</span><span class="worship-star worship-star-two">✧</span><span class="worship-cloud worship-cloud-one"></span><span class="worship-cloud worship-cloud-two"></span></div>
        <header class="worship-intro ways-intro"><p class="eyebrow">A note from your goddess</p><p class="worship-constellation" aria-hidden="true">✦&nbsp;✧&nbsp;✦</p><h1>Ways to <em>Worship.</em></h1></header>
        <div class="worship-prose ways-prose">
          <p>The moon never begs for attention. She just pulls the tide, and everything obeys. I've always thought she and I had a lot in common.</p>
          <p>The ones who stand out are never forgotten. They're the ones I remember.</p>
          <p>Now. Pay attention, because I'm only writing this once.</p>
          <p>I am La Davina Emilia. I am a goddess, and I live like one, because I built this life and I keep it. I already have money. I don't need yours. I want it, and more than that, I want what your tribute means: that you looked at my life, my standards, my world, and decided it deserved a piece of yours.</p>
          <p>I am not a cruel goddess. I don't scream, I don't insult, and I don't traffic in humiliation for the masses. My punishment is far more effective: I go quiet, and I tell you I'm disappointed. If you know, you know. If you don't yet, you will.</p>
          <p>My rules are three, and they are simple, and they are not negotiable. Read them. Learn them. Then start at the beginning, the way everyone does.</p>
          <p><a class="text-link" href="/rules.php">Read the Rules <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></p>
          <hr class="ways-divider">
          <p class="eyebrow">An offering, properly made</p>
          <p>Money is how you say it. This is how you send it.</p>
          <p>Every avenue below reaches me. Choose the one that fits the moment, and know that how you tribute tells me as much as how much.</p>
          <section class="ways-list" aria-label="Tribute avenues">
            <article class="way-card"><p class="eyebrow">Throne <em>(the classic)</em></p><p>My wishlist and my gift throne. The everyday avenue for the devoted. Small tributes, wishlist pieces, spontaneous offerings. If you're new and nervous, start here. It's the gentlest way to make yourself known to me.</p><a class="button button-primary" href="https://throne.com/ladavinaemilia" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Visit my Throne <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
            <article class="way-card"><p class="eyebrow">Direct Tribute <em>(the statement)</em></p><p>YouPay, for the man who wants his tribute to arrive directly, discreetly, and without ceremony. Neutral on your statements. Unmistakable in its meaning. This is for tributes with intent.</p><a class="button button-primary" href="https://youpay.me/ladavinaemilia" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Offer a direct tribute <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
            <article class="way-card"><p class="eyebrow">Crypto <em>(the private)</em></p><p>For my privacy-minded ones and my big sends. No chargebacks, no questions, no trail. Ask me properly and I'll provide my wallet. If you don't know how to use it, that's a you problem, and I say that with love.</p><a class="button button-primary" href="mailto:hi@ladavinaemilia.com?subject=Crypto%20wallet%20request">Contact for my wallet <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
          </section>
          <p>A note on gifts: I appreciate my money above all things. If you're going to send a gift instead, understand that it must be extraordinary to compete with cash. My Throne wishlist exists because I've already curated it. Anything outside it had better be exceptional, or expensive, and ideally both.</p>
          <p>And a note for the record: tributes are just that, tributes. Gifts freely given to a goddess. I don't refund them, and I don't negotiate with them. A man who tributes me has made a decision, and I respect his decisions, which is more than I can say for most people in his life.</p>
          <p class="ways-closing">Choose your avenue. Make your offering.</p>
          <p class="ways-signoff">The moon is always pulling. 💋</p>
